about: Guides and tutorials for selene.

name: IMEI Backup
maintainer: redmi_9indonesia
url: https://t.me/Redmi10_Community/337581
note: Guide to backup IMEI on MediaTek devices (Lancelot/Lava, Redmi 9 / Poco M2). Methods: sptool, via TWRP, recovery-flashable backup zip, via Termux. Credits: @Box_Boi, @mochi_wwww, @Akash23q2.
vendor: all

name: Flash fastboot ROM without PC
maintainer: Akash (@Akash23q2)
url: https://telegra.ph/Flashing-fastboot-rom-without-pc-07-26
note: Guide to flash MIUI fastboot ROM without a PC (OTG + extra phone). Methods: Root (Termux) or Non-Root (Bugjaegar app). Credits: @Akash23q2 @Orainegena @Boi_Box.
vendor: all

name: Install Custom ROM (Selene)
maintainer: unknown
url: https://t.me/Redmi10_Community/329148
note: Tutorial to install custom ROMs on Redmi 10 (selene). Requirements: unlocked bootloader, PC with adb/fastboot/SP Flash Tools, MIUI stock ROM, recovery ROM on microSD/OTG. Steps: flash TWRP/OFOX, format data, flash MIUI recovery ROM + custom ROM (same vendor) in one pass; for S Vendor use MIUI 13 first. Includes special case fix for bootloop on eMMC/NFC variants. BACKUP IMEI FIRST.
vendor: all

name: Fix device undetected by fastboot
maintainer: unknown
url: https://t.me/Redmi10_Community/340462
note: Video tutorial to fix device undetected by fastboot.
vendor: all

name: Fix Hardware Decoder (Selene)
maintainer: unknown
url: https://t.me/Redmi10_Community/297213
note: Module to fix hardware decoder on selene. Works on KernelSU/KSU-Next/Magisk/APatch, supports all Custom ROMs.
vendor: all

name: Magisk TWRP Dump Method
maintainer: Fukiame
url: https://t.me/Redmi10_Community/92804
note: Guide to root with Magisk via TWRP on any ROM. Steps: dump boot img in TWRP terminal (dd if=/dev/block/by-name/boot_a of=/external_sd/boot_a.img; use boot_b/sdcard1 if needed), patch with Magisk, flash patched img to boot in TWRP. No data format required.
vendor: all

name: Rvendor Custom ROM video
maintainer: Bendejo
url: https://youtu.be/Yn1A0mGw6Ck
note: Video tutorial to install Rvendor custom ROMs on selene.
vendor: all

name: Rvendor Custom ROM Guide (XDA)
maintainer: Neelthegamer007
url: https://xdaforums.com/t/xiaomi-redmi-10-redmi-10-prime-redmi-10-2022-redmi-10-2021-selene-custom-rom-installation-video-tutorial.4583503/
note: XDA forum post with custom ROM installation video tutorial for Redmi 10 series (selene).
